  "zh": "# 今日科技产品频发：华为折叠屏内部结构首曝，小米汽车亲民版上市，特斯拉降价引争议。\n## AI 与科技\n- **华为三折叠手机内部结构首拆**：揭示折叠屏技术最新突破，引发行业关注。\n- **6G手机商用前景分析**：预示下一代通信技术研发进展，影响未来手机形态。\n## 产品发布\n- **小米汽车最便宜车型发布**：亲民定价或将加速电动车普及，市场影响显著。\n- **雷军发布小米史上最贵手机**：旗舰定位提升，彰显小米向高端市场冲击。\n## 行业动向\n- **特斯拉限时降价引发车主不满**：价格策略波动凸显竞争加剧，可能影响品牌忠诚度。\n- **华为小米苹果万元机市场竞争**：三巨头在高价位段展开激烈博弈，格局值得观察。\n## 社会民生\n- **偷拍未公开战机案件详情披露**：涉及国家安全，提醒公众保密意识的重要性。\n- **测试卡车与数据车相撞致5人死亡**：暴露自动驾驶测试安全风险，监管需跟进。",
  "en": "# Today's tech highlights: Huawei reveals triple‑fold phone internals, Xiaomi launches affordable EV, Tesla price cut sparks backlash.\n## AI & Tech\n- **Huawei triple‑fold phone internal structure teardown**: Reveals latest breakthrough in foldable screen tech, drawing industry attention.\n- **6G phone commercial prospects analysis**: Signals next‑gen communications R&D progress, shaping future handset design.\n## Product Launches\n- **Xiaomi launches most affordable car model**: Low‑price EV may accelerate mass adoption, marking significant market impact.\n- **Lei Jun unveils Xiaomi's highest‑priced smartphone**: Flagship push highlights Xiaomi's move into the premium segment.\n## Industry Trends\n- **Tesla temporary price cut sparks owner backlash**: Pricing volatility reflects intensifying competition and may affect brand loyalty.\n- **Huawei, Xiaomi, Apple battle over ten‑thousand‑yuan phones**: Three giants clash in the high‑price segment, a trend worth watching.\n## Society\n- **Undisclosed military aircraft spy case details disclosed**: Involves national security, underscoring the importance of confidentiality awareness.\n- **Test truck collides with data‑collection vehicle, five killed**: Exposes safety risks in autonomous‑vehicle testing, calling for stricter oversight."
